{"v":1,"book":"Isa","ch":56,"verses":[{"n":1,"text":"Thus says Jehovah, Preserve justice and do righteousness, For My salvation is about to come And My righteousness is about to be revealed.","tok":[{"t":"Thus "},{"t":"says","s":["H0559"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[2]},{"t":", Preserve "},{"t":"justice","s":["H6666"],"a":[6]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"do","s":["H6213"],"a":[5]},{"t":" righteousness, For My "},{"t":"salvation","s":["H3444"],"a":[9]},{"t":" is "},{"t":"about","s":["H7138"],"a":[8]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"come","s":["H0935"],"a":[10]},{"t":" And My "},{"t":"righteousness","s":["H6666"],"a":[11]},{"t":" is about to be "},{"t":"revealed","s":["H1540"],"a":[12]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":2,"text":"Blessed is the man who does this, And the son of man who takes hold of it, Who keeps the Sabbath so as not to profane it And keeps his hand from doing any evil.","tok":[{"t":"Blessed","s":["H0835"],"a":[0]},{"t":" is the "},{"t":"man","s":["H0582"],"a":[1]},{"t":" who "},{"t":"does","s":["H6213"],"a":[2]},{"t":" this, And the "},{"t":"son","s":["H1121"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"man","s":["H0120"],"a":[5]},{"t":" who takes "},{"t":"hold","s":["H2388"],"a":[6]},{"t":" of it, Who "},{"t":"keeps","s":["H8104"],"a":[8]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"Sabbath","s":["H7676"],"a":[9]},{"t":" so as not to "},{"t":"profane","s":["H2490"],"a":[10]},{"t":" it And "},{"t":"keeps","s":["H8104"],"a":[11]},{"t":" his "},{"t":"hand","s":["H3027"],"a":[12]},{"t":" from "},{"t":"doing","s":["H6213"],"a":[13]},{"t":" any "},{"t":"evil","s":["H7451"],"a":[15]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":3,"text":"And let not the son of a foreigner Who has joined himself to Jehovah speak, saying, Jehovah will surely separate me from His people; Nor let the eunuch say, Now I am a dry tree.","tok":[{"t":"And let not the "},{"t":"son","s":["H1121"],"a":[2]},{"t":" of a foreigner Who has "},{"t":"joined","s":["H3867"],"a":[4]},{"t":" himself to "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[6]},{"t":" "},{"t":"speak","s":["H0559"],"a":[1]},{"t":", "},{"t":"saying","s":["H0559"],"a":[7]},{"t":", "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[10]},{"t":" will surely "},{"t":"separate","s":["H0914"],"a":[9]},{"t":" me from His "},{"t":"people","s":["H5971"],"a":[12]},{"t":"; Nor let the "},{"t":"eunuch","s":["H5631"],"a":[15]},{"t":" "},{"t":"say","s":["H0559"],"a":[14]},{"t":", Now I am a "},{"t":"dry","s":["H3002"],"a":[19]},{"t":" "},{"t":"tree","s":["H6086"],"a":[18]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":4,"text":"For thus says Jehovah, To the eunuchs who keep My Sabbaths And choose what pleases Me, And hold fast My covenant,","tok":[{"t":"For thus "},{"t":"says","s":["H0559"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[3]},{"t":", To the "},{"t":"eunuchs","s":["H5631"],"a":[4]},{"t":" who "},{"t":"keep","s":["H8104"],"a":[6]},{"t":" My "},{"t":"Sabbaths","s":["H7676"],"a":[8]},{"t":" And "},{"t":"choose","s":["H0977"],"a":[9]},{"t":" what "},{"t":"pleases","s":["H2654"],"a":[11]},{"t":" Me, And "},{"t":"hold","s":["H2388"],"a":[12]},{"t":" fast My "},{"t":"covenant","s":["H1285"],"a":[13]},{"t":","}]},{"n":5,"text":"To them I will give in My house and within My walls a memorial and a name Better than that of sons and daughters; I will give them an eternal name Which will not be cut off.","tok":[{"t":"To them I will "},{"t":"give","s":["H5414"],"a":[0]},{"t":" in My "},{"t":"house","s":["H1004"],"a":[2]},{"t":" and within My "},{"t":"walls","s":["H2346"],"a":[3]},{"t":" a "},{"t":"memorial","s":["H3027"],"a":[4]},{"t":" and a "},{"t":"name","s":["H8034"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Better","s":["H2896"],"a":[6]},{"t":" than that of "},{"t":"sons","s":["H1121"],"a":[7]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"daughters","s":["H1323"],"a":[8]},{"t":"; I will "},{"t":"give","s":["H5414"],"a":[11]},{"t":" them an eternal "},{"t":"name","s":["H8034"],"a":[9]},{"t":" Which will not be cut "},{"t":"off","s":["H3772"],"a":[15]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":6,"text":"Also the children of the foreigner who join themselves to Jehovah, To minister to Him and to love the name of Jehovah, To be servants to Him, Everyone who keeps the Sabbath so as not to profane it And holds fast My covenant,","tok":[{"t":"Also the children of the foreigner who "},{"t":"join","s":["H3867"],"a":[2]},{"t":" themselves to "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[4]},{"t":", To minister to Him and to "},{"t":"love","s":["H0157"],"a":[6]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"name","s":["H8034"],"a":[8]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[9]},{"t":", To be "},{"t":"servants","s":["H5650"],"a":[12]},{"t":" to Him, Everyone who "},{"t":"keeps","s":["H8104"],"a":[14]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"Sabbath","s":["H7676"],"a":[15]},{"t":" so as not to "},{"t":"profane","s":["H2490"],"a":[16]},{"t":" it And "},{"t":"holds","s":["H2388"],"a":[17]},{"t":" fast My "},{"t":"covenant","s":["H1285"],"a":[18]},{"t":","}]},{"n":7,"text":"Even these will I cause to come to My holy mountain And to rejoice in My house of prayer; Their burnt offerings and their sacrifices will be acceptable upon My altar; For My house will be called a house of prayer for all the peoples.","tok":[{"t":"Even these will I cause to come to My "},{"t":"holy","s":["H6944"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"mountain","s":["H2022"],"a":[2]},{"t":" And to rejoice in My "},{"t":"house","s":["H1004"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"prayer","s":["H8605"],"a":[6]},{"t":"; Their burnt "},{"t":"offerings","s":["H5930"],"a":[7]},{"t":" and their "},{"t":"sacrifices","s":["H2077"],"a":[8]},{"t":" will be acceptable upon My "},{"t":"altar","s":["H4196"],"a":[11]},{"t":"; For My "},{"t":"house","s":["H1004"],"a":[13]},{"t":" will be "},{"t":"called","s":["H7121"],"a":[16]},{"t":" a "},{"t":"house","s":["H1004"],"a":[14]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"prayer","s":["H8605"],"a":[15]},{"t":" for all the "},{"t":"peoples","s":["H5971"],"a":[18]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":8,"text":"The Lord Jehovah, who gathers the outcasts of Israel, declares: Yet will I gather others to Him besides those gathered to Him already.","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"Lord","s":["H0136"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3069"],"a":[2]},{"t":", who "},{"t":"gathers","s":["H6908"],"a":[3]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"outcasts","s":["H1760"]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Israel","s":["H3478"],"a":[5]},{"t":", declares: Yet will I "},{"t":"gather","s":["H6908"],"a":[7]},{"t":" others to Him besides those "},{"t":"gathered","s":["H6908"],"a":[9]},{"t":" to Him already."}]},{"n":9,"text":"All you animals of the field, come to eat, All you animals of the forest.","tok":[{"t":"All you animals of the "},{"t":"field","s":["H7704"],"a":[2]},{"t":", "},{"t":"come","s":["H0857"],"a":[3]},{"t":" to eat, All you animals of the "},{"t":"forest","s":["H3293"],"a":[7]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":10,"text":"His watchmen are blind; All of them know nothing; All of them are dumb dogs, They cannot bark; Dreamers who lie down And love to slumber.","tok":[{"t":"His "},{"t":"watchmen","s":["H6822"],"a":[0]},{"t":" are "},{"t":"blind","s":["H5787"],"a":[1]},{"t":"; All of them know nothing; All of them are "},{"t":"dumb","s":["H0483"],"a":[7]},{"t":" "},{"t":"dogs","s":["H3611"],"a":[6]},{"t":", They "},{"t":"cannot","s":["H3201"],"a":[9]},{"t":" "},{"t":"bark","s":["H5024"],"a":[10]},{"t":"; Dreamers who lie "},{"t":"down","s":["H7901"],"a":[12]},{"t":" And "},{"t":"love","s":["H0157"],"a":[13]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"slumber","s":["H5123"],"a":[14]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":11,"text":"And these dogs are greedy; They know no satisfaction. And they are shepherds Who lack understanding. All of them have turned to their own way, Each to his own gain, to the last of them.","tok":[{"t":"And "},{"t":"these","s":["H5794"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"dogs","s":["H3611"],"a":[0]},{"t":" are "},{"t":"greedy","s":["H5794"],"a":[1]},{"t":"; They know no satisfaction. And they are "},{"t":"shepherds","s":["H7462"],"a":[7]},{"t":" Who lack "},{"t":"understanding","s":["H0995"],"a":[10]},{"t":". All of them "},{"t":"have","s":["H3045"],"a":[9]},{"t":" turned to their own "},{"t":"way","s":["H1870"],"a":[12]},{"t":", Each to his own "},{"t":"gain","s":["H1215"],"a":[15]},{"t":", to the last of them."}]},{"n":12,"text":"Come, they say, let me get some wine, And let us drink down some liquor; And tomorrow will be like today, Only much more abundant.","tok":[{"t":"Come","s":["H0857"],"a":[0]},{"t":", they say, let me get some "},{"t":"wine","s":["H3196"],"a":[2]},{"t":", And let us "},{"t":"drink","s":["H7941"],"a":[4]},{"t":" down some liquor; And tomorrow will be like today, Only "},{"t":"much","s":["H3966"],"a":[11]},{"t":" "},{"t":"more","s":["H3499"],"a":[10]},{"t":" "},{"t":"abundant","s":["H1419"],"a":[9]},{"t":"."}]}]}
